                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "7cb21435-8dd1-48c2-8ada-4cbe0701d76c",
                                "sense_id": "3be1dbf3-dc41-35b4-90fa-874f8f380a46",
                                "text": "L'application Stop Covid sera-t-elle en service le 11 mai ? C'est en tout cas ce que souhaite le gouvernement.",
                                "translation": "Will the app Stop Covid go online May 11th? In any case, that is what the government wants.",
                                "english": "Will the app Stop Covid go online May 11th? In any case, that is what the government wants."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5226cc58-1b15-4ac9-949d-032568e4e7d7",
                                "sense_id": "3be1dbf3-dc41-35b4-90fa-874f8f380a46",
                                "text": "Le centre hospitalier de Saintonge a concrétisé ce lundi la première vague de vaccination contre le Covid. Priorité au personnel de santé et aux 1 200 résidents de maisons de retraite.",
                                "translation": "The Saintonge hospital center began the first wave of vaccinations against Covid on Monday. Priority is given to healthcare workers and the 1,200 residents of retirement homes.",
                                "english": "The Saintonge hospital center began the first wave of vaccinations against Covid on Monday. Priority is given to healthcare workers and the 1,200 residents of retirement homes."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "eec23f2c-430f-4093-83a4-e0dc9382d0ba",
                                "sense_id": "3be1dbf3-dc41-35b4-90fa-874f8f380a46",
                                "text": "Oui, et 80 000 en sont mortes, d'autres en ont réchappé parfois après quelques semaines sous respirateur (heureusement on arrive souvent à l'éviter), et beaucoup sont restées malades des formes prolongées, le fameux Covid long.",
                                "translation": "Yes, 80,000 have died, and others have gotten by with a few weeks on a respirator (thankfully they are often able to avoid that), and many remain ill with prolonged forms, the famous long Covid.",
                                "english": "Yes, 80,000 have died, and others have gotten by with a few weeks on a respirator (thankfully they are often able to avoid that), and many remain ill with prolonged forms, the famous long Covid."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
